WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:07.120
Waves crash upon shores as the Tide's eternal song echoes through the void.

2
00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:17.440
Breathe, little spark. Adrift upon currents far from your origin. Yes, the disorientation,

3
00:00:18.080 --> 00:00:23.200
it clings like sea mist. You have washed upon the shores of Ilyr,

4
00:00:23.200 --> 00:00:29.280
a world that likely feels fundamentally wrong to your senses, yet strangely resonant.

5
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:36.480
Do not fight the confusion. It is the nature of arrival here, a passage through the unseen eddies

6
00:00:36.480 --> 00:00:43.760
that churn between realities. You are here now, and the now of Ilyr is a thing woven from echoes

7
00:00:43.760 --> 00:00:50.960
and storms. Look beyond your immediate footing. See how the light falls differently here, perhaps?

8
00:00:50.960 --> 00:00:57.760
How shadows seem deeper, holding whispers your ears almost catch? Feel the very air,

9
00:00:57.760 --> 00:01:04.240
thick with energies that vibrate just beneath perception? This is Ilyr as it is, a realm

10
00:01:04.240 --> 00:01:09.680
sculpted by forces that disregard the neat lines of cause and effect your own time might have known.

11
00:01:10.320 --> 00:01:16.720
Civilizations rise here, not just on solid ground, but amongst impossible Floating Mountains that

12
00:01:16.720 --> 00:01:24.000
drift on unseen currents. Forests pulse with unsettling bioluminescence. Deserts howl with

13
00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:31.040
storms that taste of ozone and something other. And the deep oceans cradle secrets far older and

14
00:01:31.040 --> 00:01:37.360
stranger than the surface dwellers comprehend. The peoples you encounter, the Ilyrian races,

15
00:01:37.920 --> 00:01:44.000
they reflect this fractured beauty. They are beings born of adaptation, their forms often

16
00:01:44.000 --> 00:01:50.720
merging flesh with stone, light with shadow, mechanism with life. They wield powers that

17
00:01:50.720 --> 00:01:57.600
might seem like magic to you, bending gravity, whispering to time, shaping matter with focused will,

18
00:01:58.160 --> 00:02:04.720
touching minds across vast distances. Do not mistake this for mere chaos. It is the intricate

19
00:02:04.720 --> 00:02:11.600
harmony of survival in a world where the fundamental laws have been retuned. They live amidst

20
00:02:11.600 --> 00:02:17.120
ruins that sing forgotten histories and build cities that hum with energies drawn from the

21
00:02:17.120 --> 00:02:23.040
planet's altered heart. They remember little of the world before the great changes, their pasts

22
00:02:23.040 --> 00:02:29.920
often as fragmented and dreamlike as your own sudden arrival. What force sculpted such a reality?

23
00:02:30.480 --> 00:02:36.720
What power underpins this constant state of flux, this blending of the mundane and the miraculous?

24
00:02:37.280 --> 00:02:44.160
It is the deep, pervasive rhythm the inhabitants name, the Tide. Think of it not as a singular

25
00:02:44.160 --> 00:02:51.040
catastrophe that struck and faded, but as the enduring ocean upon which this reality floats.

26
00:02:51.760 --> 00:02:58.640
It is the underlying song, the cosmic breath that dictates the ebb and flow of possibility here.

27
00:02:59.280 --> 00:03:06.400
The Tide washed through existence across vast cycles, thinning the veils, allowing the profound

28
00:03:06.400 --> 00:03:13.040
and the perilous to intermingle, leaving behind its indelible signature in Three Consequences

29
00:03:13.040 --> 00:03:19.920
that define every aspect of life on Ilyr. Listen, and perhaps you will begin to understand

30
00:03:19.920 --> 00:03:26.800
the verses of this eternal song. The first consequence, felt as a tremor in the very bones

31
00:03:26.800 --> 00:03:35.200
of the planet, was the Drowning. The physical laws seemed to sigh and shift. Lands convulsed,

32
00:03:35.200 --> 00:03:42.640
coastlines vanished under hungry waters, mountains shattered, some plunging into fiery oblivion,

33
00:03:42.640 --> 00:03:48.480
others torn loose to hang suspended in the troubled sky, islands adrift on currents of

34
00:03:48.480 --> 00:03:55.280
altered gravity. Cities built across millennia vanished overnight, leaving behind ghostly ruins

35
00:03:55.280 --> 00:04:03.120
or gaping maws in the earth, where connection once thrived, fragmentation bloomed. From this reshaping,

36
00:04:03.120 --> 00:04:10.240
survivors clung to islands of stability, some sealed in desperate isolation, others reaching out,

37
00:04:10.240 --> 00:04:16.480
becoming fragile harbors for the displaced, all forever marked by the memory of solid ground

38
00:04:16.480 --> 00:04:21.520
yielding beneath them, forever navigating the turbulent waters of this new age.

39
00:04:23.120 --> 00:04:29.200
The second consequence, the Divergence, resonated within the survivors themselves,

40
00:04:29.200 --> 00:04:35.680
an awakening of potentials long dormant, or perhaps entirely new. The fundamental forces

41
00:04:35.680 --> 00:04:40.800
of the universe seemed to offer themselves to those who could perceive their altered harmony.

42
00:04:40.800 --> 00:04:47.920
Gravity yielded its secrets, granting flight or crushing weight. Time frayed at the edges,

43
00:04:47.920 --> 00:04:55.040
becoming a weapon or a shield for those attuned to its flow. Matter itself grew mutable, responsive

44
00:04:55.040 --> 00:05:01.840
to focused will, enabling acts of creation or healing once deemed impossible. The unseen

45
00:05:01.840 --> 00:05:08.720
threads connecting minds allowed passage across space, or the brief summoning of echoes. Light,

46
00:05:08.720 --> 00:05:16.560
heat, the very essence of energy, answered new masters. These abilities, wondrous and terrifying,

47
00:05:16.560 --> 00:05:23.680
are now woven into the fabric of Ilyr, seeding conflict and innovation alike. Wonder and peril

48
00:05:23.680 --> 00:05:31.600
became intimate companions. The third consequence, the Drift, is the chaotic tide that likely carried

49
00:05:31.600 --> 00:05:38.720
you here. Spacetime itself frayed, opening Drifts, shimmering anomalies, gateways through which

50
00:05:38.720 --> 00:05:46.320
fragments of other realities, other timelines, wash ashore onto Ilyr. Entire populations, relics

51
00:05:46.320 --> 00:05:54.240
of forgotten epochs, shards of worlds utterly alien, arrive unbidden, forming fragile enclaves.

52
00:05:54.240 --> 00:05:59.840
These pockets of the displaced struggle for existence, facing monstrous creatures born of the

53
00:05:59.840 --> 00:06:06.800
Tide, the suspicion of Ilyr's natives and the echoes of their own severed histories. They stand now

54
00:06:06.800 --> 00:06:14.720
as living paradoxes, constant reminders that the boundaries of reality here are porous, forever

55
00:06:14.720 --> 00:06:23.200
shifting. So you stand now upon Ilyr, a world breathing the aftermath and the ongoing resonance

56
00:06:23.280 --> 00:06:30.640
of the Tide. The rules you knew are memories carried on the wind. Here, science and myth dance

57
00:06:30.640 --> 00:06:39.280
together in the deep currents. Survival is fluidity. Resilience is attunement. The past is not gone,

58
00:06:39.280 --> 00:06:46.000
merely displaced, drifting alongside a present teeming with volatile potential. Feel the

59
00:06:46.000 --> 00:06:53.040
vibrations beneath your feet. Listen beyond the sounds you recognize. Your arrival is another

60
00:06:53.040 --> 00:07:01.200
ripple, another note added to the endless song. Observe, adapt, and perhaps find your own place

61
00:07:01.200 --> 00:07:07.040
within this profound, perilous harmony. And so our story begins.
